atom	things_thine	the things thou reckonest in the number of thy possessions are really thine
atom	beautiful	these things are beautiful in their own nature
atom	reason_grieve_joy	thou hast reason to grieve for their loss or find joy in their continued possession
atom	nothing_to_thee	their beauty is nothing to thee
atom	pleasing_without	they would have been not less pleasing in themselves though never included among thy possessions
